{"4411240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DEADRIFT", "steam_appid": 4411240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411240/extras/20dae786f03cda314e7855c9c68bce8a.poster.avif?t=1780257276\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411240/extras/20dae786f03cda314e7855c9c68bce8a.webm?t=1780257276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411240/extras/20dae786f03cda314e7855c9c68bce8a.mp4?t=1780257276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>DEADRIFT is a fast-paced, immersive sci-fi shooter set in a secret underground research facility. What was once humanity’s greatest scientific breakthrough—teleportation—has become its most terrible mistake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Facility in Ruins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast underground complex filled with laboratories, medical stations, security zones, and teleportation chambers. Search for weapons, ammunition, and experimental technology as you work your way deeper into the facility. Resources are scarce, creatures attack in waves, and survival is never guaranteed. Reactivate the facility’s damaged systems to unlock new areas and weapons. Reuse collected items within the facility to make your survival easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutated Nightmares</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The blue serum has transformed scientists and test subjects into relentless creatures. Some attack in swarms, others hunt from the shadows, and still others have evolved into terrifying abominations with deadly abilities. Each wave is worse than the last, putting your instincts to the test.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411240/extras/20dae786f03cda314e7855c9c68bce8a.poster.avif?t=1780257276\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411240/extras/20dae786f03cda314e7855c9c68bce8a.webm?t=1780257276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411240/extras/20dae786f03cda314e7855c9c68bce8a.mp4?t=1780257276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>DEADRIFT is a fast-paced, immersive sci-fi shooter set in a secret underground research facility. What was once humanity’s greatest scientific breakthrough—teleportation—has become its most terrible mistake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Facility in Ruins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast underground complex filled with laboratories, medical stations, security zones, and teleportation chambers. Search for weapons, ammunition, and experimental technology as you work your way deeper into the facility. Resources are scarce, creatures attack in waves, and survival is never guaranteed. Reactivate the facility’s damaged systems to unlock new areas and weapons. Reuse collected items within the facility to make your survival easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutated Nightmares</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The blue serum has transformed scientists and test subjects into relentless creatures. Some attack in swarms, others hunt from the shadows, and still others have evolved into terrifying abominations with deadly abilities. Each wave is worse than the last, putting your instincts to the test.</p>", "short_description": "A fast-paced sci-fi shooter where a failed experiment unleashes mutated horrors inside a secret research facility. Armed with expe